HELIMAC — licences

The project uses three licences depending on the type of file:

1. Hardware — CAD files, drawings, schematics, PCBs, bills of materials (BOM)
   in hardware/ and electronics/:
   CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 – Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0)
   Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt

2. Software — calc/ and firmware/:
   GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later)
   Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt

3. Documentation — docs/ and .md files:
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC-BY-SA-4.0)
   Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt

